Verse 1:
[C]We gather together to [Dm7]ask the [G]Lord's [C]blessing;
[C]He [G]chastens and [Am]has[D7]tens [G]His [Am]will to [D7]make [G]known;
[G]The [G7]wicked op[C]pressing now [Dm7]cease [G7]from dis[C]tressing,
[C]Sing [F]praises to His [G]name; [C]He for[Dm]gets [G7]not His [C]own.

Verse 2:
[C]Beside us [Dm7]to guide us, [G]our God [C]with us joining,
[C][G]Ordaining, [Am][D7]maintaining [G]His [Am][D7]kingdom [G]divine;
