Verse 3:
[C]We all [Dm7]do extol [G]Thee, Thou [C]leader triumphant,
[C]And [G]pray [Am]that [D7]Thou [G]still [Am]our [D7]defender [G]wilt be.
[G][G7]Let [C]Thy [Dm7]congregation [G7]escape [C]tribulation;
